### Classification Types

- **full-slice** — End-to-end feature (domain → application → infrastructure → desktop → frontend)
- **backend** — Rust crate changes only
- **frontend** — TypeScript UI changes only
- **infrastructure** — Persistence, filesystem, settings changes
- **docs** — Documentation, context, or spec changes

